{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111180","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111180","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1211118001:0":{"text":"真的有宝藏……","source_cn":"真的有宝藏……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA85F871C8681E69A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211118002:0":{"text":"我喜欢这艘船。从现在起，它是我的了！","source_cn":"我喜欢这艘船。从现在起，它是我的了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF275E2BDA32056C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211118003:0":{"text":"这个瓶子……好像童话书上的漂流瓶。","source_cn":"这个瓶子……好像童话书上的漂流瓶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDCE67B18DF9CAFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211118004:0":{"text":"它也太大了……只有巨人才会做这么大的漂流瓶吧？","source_cn":"它也太大了……只有巨人才会做这么大的漂流瓶吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA844958C087E37CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211118005:0":{"text":"漂流瓶里一般装的都是沙子、纸星星、花，或者是卷起来的信。","source_cn":"漂流瓶里一般装的都是沙子、纸星星、花，或者是卷起来的信。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A487EDA7352454","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211118006:0":{"te